<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 2.208 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 2.208 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 2.208 billion pesos from the secondary market on Friday through four auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>    750 million    27 days</p>
<p>    750 million    26 days</p>
<p>    510 million    20 days</p>
<p>    198 million     3 days</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
